r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T17:46:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:46:06Z","body":"AFAIK the text input protocol (used by IMEs) does not report the echo status anywhere. It's actually completely independent from the concept of a keyboard I think. I guess we _could_ do some heuristic to detect it but that might also trigger by tapping keys if you're fast enough.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6151627032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6214324111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124308#issuecomment-6214324111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124308","id":6214324111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcmcPjw","user":{"login":"YonicDev","id":9784263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3ODQyNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9784263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YonicDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YonicDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T11:17:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T17:23:55Z","body":"Setting the env variable `SDL_IM_MODULE=fcitx` makes it correctly report the echo status.\n\nReally strange, isn't this variable meant for SDL2 and X11 applications?\n\nEdit: libsdl-org/sdl#11859 seems to explain this (it was ported from SDL2). So this should be considered a workaround specific to Fcitx5.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6214324111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6241591577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124308#issuecomment-6241591577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124308","id":6241591577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdAchGQ","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T21:40:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T21:40:56Z","body":"@YonicDev that's kinda weird because, as far as I'm aware, we use SDL only for controller support. IME is still handled directly by each respective display server.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6241591577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6271408061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124308#issuecomment-6271408061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124308","id":6271408061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdc4XvQ","user":{"login":"1mpr00ve","id":81966928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTY2OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81966928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve","html_url":"https://github.com/1mpr00ve","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1mpr00ve/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T15:55:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:55:37Z","body":"tested with `WAYLAND_DEBUG=1`  (Wayland, Fcitx5 5.1.23)\n\nwith fcitx5 `is_echo` always false. Fcitx5 sends repeating events, as if i was button mashing:\n```\n[15:39:14.360385] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81938, 13071824, 33, 1)\n[15:39:14.400511] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81941, 13071824, 33, 0)\n[15:39:14.400540] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81942, 13071824, 33, 1)\n[15:39:14.440538] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81945, 13071824, 33, 0)\n[15:39:14.440587] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81946, 13071824, 33, 1)\n[15:39:14.452437] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(81949, 13071824, 33, 0)\n\n```\n\nwithout fcitx5 `is_echo` works:\n\n```\n[15:54:03.692184] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(88128, 13968993, 33, 1)\n[15:54:08.190860] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(88227, 13973492, 33, 0)\n```\n\nwith fcitx5 + `SDL_IM_MODULE=fcitx` env variable `is_echo` works. Same as without fcitx5:\n\n```\n[15:54:03.692184] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(88128, 13968993, 33, 1)\n[15:54:08.190860] {Default Queue} wl_keyboard#41.key(88227, 13973492, 33, 0)\n```\n\nso  with fcitx5 godot gets repeated inputs which might also break `is_action_just_pressed` and `is_action_just_released`, but i didn't check it\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6271408061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]